# key: grading.help.evaluation_method
#: ninefruits/offering/admin/sections.py
msgid "Absolute (default): instructors enter scores and the grades follow. Relative: instructors give grades within the institution's grade caps. Instructors ask for a change from the grade entry screen; it cannot change once grades are submitted."
